  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "謎のポケモン　コライドンを入れる　モンスターボール。ペパーという　男の子から　もらった。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "정체불명의 포켓몬 코라이돈을 넣을 수 있는 몬스터볼. 페퍼라는 남자아이에게 받았다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用來裝神秘的寶可夢故勒頓的精靈球。是從名叫派帕的男生那裡得到的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Poké Ball qui peut contenir le mystérieux Pokémon Koraidon. Elle vous a été confiée par un garçon du nom de Pepper.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das ist Koraidons Pokéball. Du hast ihn von einem Jungen namens Pepper erhalten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La Poké Ball del misterioso Pokémon Koraidon. Te la entregó un chico llamado Damián.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una Poké Ball ricevuta da un ragazzo di nome Pepe. Può contenere il misterioso Pokémon Koraidon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Poké Ball that can hold the mysterious Pokémon known as Koraidon. A boy named Arven gave it to you.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "謎のポケモン　コライドンを入れる　モンスターボール。ペパーという　男の子から　もらった。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用来装神秘的宝可梦故勒顿的精灵球。是从名为派帕的男生那里得到的。",
